OL,4,CUganda to withdraw troops from DR      
OL,5,CCongo town amid diplomatic row         
OL,6,GUganda has announced plans to withdraw 
OL,7,Gits troops from a town in eastern      
OL,8,GDemocratic Republic of Congo within    
OL,9,Gtwo weeks, as diplomatic tensions      
OL,10,Gescalate between the two neighbours.   
OL,12,FThe troops will hand over security in  
OL,13,FLubero, in North Kivu province, to     
OL,14,FCongolese forces after nearly two      
OL,15,Fyears of military operations, the      
OL,16,FUgandan army said in a statement on    
OL,17,FFriday.                                
